Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:54:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 53/60] Sign-in page: a "Face liveness demo" pill and a login
 card without the black outline (task 21, B)

Visual only; the login logic and its texts are unchanged.
- Debug and profile builds: the corner "Liveness test" text button is a
  white outlined pill with a face icon, "Face liveness demo"; it opens
  LivenessDemoPage (the debug page is its "Developer tools"). Release
  builds still show nothing there.
- The login card (all builds): no outline; white, radius 16, a soft
  shadow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
